1792353628,,ui,error,No usable default provider could be found for your system.\n\nVagrant relies on interactions with 3rd party systems%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) known as\n"providers"%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) to provide Vagrant with resources to run development\nenvironments. Examples are VirtualBox%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) VMware%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) Hyper-V.\n\nThe easiest solution to this message is to install VirtualBox%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) which\nis available for free on all major platforms.\n\nIf you believe you already have a provider available%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) make sure it\nis properly installed and configured. You can see more details about\nwhy a particular provider isn't working by forcing usage with\n`vagrant up --provider=PROVIDER`%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) which should give you a more specific\nerror message for that particular provider.
1792353628,,error-exit,Vagrant::Errors::NoDefaultProvider,No usable default provider could be found for your system.\n\nVagrant relies on interactions with 3rd party systems%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) known as\n"providers"%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) to provide Vagrant with resources to run development\nenvironments. Examples are VirtualBox%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) VMware%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) Hyper-V.\n\nThe easiest solution to this message is to install VirtualBox%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) which\nis available for free on all major platforms.\n\nIf you believe you already have a provider available%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) make sure it\nis properly installed and configured. You can see more details about\nwhy a particular provider isn't working by forcing usage with\n`vagrant up --provider=PROVIDER`%!(VAGRANT_COMMA) which should give you a more specific\nerror message for that particular provider.
